{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of the distant universe, a sudden disaster takes you to a strange planet full of unknowns and dangers. As the only survivor in the mission, you must rely on your own wisdom and courage to resist wave after wave of alien creatures until reinforcements arrive. In this unfamiliar land, survival is no longer a choice, but the only goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic shooting: The weapon fires automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/83afb55e7ef68888a677940811262036.poster.avif?t=1773927517\" width=640 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/83afb55e7ef68888a677940811262036.webm?t=1773927517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/83afb55e7ef68888a677940811262036.mp4?t=1773927517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced battles: Each battle brings a thrilling and intense gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Diverse character selection: 46 characters to choose from, including one handed weapon expert, berserker attacker, lucky one, mage, etc., to create your own unique combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/1d1aba22baf4b1d4bdde51e2decba494.avif?t=1773927517\" width=1560 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich weapons and props: Hundreds of weapons and props for you to choose from, from flamethrowers, submachine guns, rocket launchers to staffs and stones, everything is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Enemy Attack Waves: Each wave of enemy attacks lasts for 20 to 90 seconds, challenging your survival limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and store system: Upgrade by picking up experience and go to the store to purchase items during enemy attacks to enhance combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/32413d9139111a13b033a7e54418d2fa.poster.avif?t=1773927517\" width=640 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/32413d9139111a13b033a7e54418d2fa.webm?t=1773927517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/32413d9139111a13b033a7e54418d2fa.mp4?t=1773927517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/e568c416989707d7fb95299d380f6f00.poster.avif?t=1773927517\" width=640 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/e568c416989707d7fb95299d380f6f00.webm?t=1773927517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/extras/e568c416989707d7fb95299d380f6f00.mp4?t=1773927517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom difficulty settings: You can adjust the enemy's health, damage, and speed to create the most suitable survival challenge for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Bloody Alien', survival is not just a goal, but also a glorious battle. Pick up your weapon, embrace the challenge, and write your own heroic legend!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Material Hoarding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/d2a34ce2aab841a3ddbb9147188709903edbf28a.jpg"},{"name":"Overload Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/3d312ca8e21a1c4a6d2efe6045ed3dc4c29ccc23.jpg"},{"name":"Biochemical Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/9fb017ab18960c60c09291fce1af89af9c74fb18.jpg"},{"name":"Stasis Field","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/b3a9b8c17e0fca55e9278d9823693ebd76b9606d.jpg"},{"name":"Negative Energy Recovery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/d939c6548ece89316032fd8f30433beeb070b0b9.jpg"},{"name":"Quantum Armament","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/91ca2344b94d94d407a0207eeb285f68a957c9d7.jpg"},{"name":"Aurum - Machinery Fusion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/bf3bf7aa63992c23277fd1c1c8d512f47b96e716.jpg"},{"name":"Enhanced Physique","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/088bb9536e6e004a824aa743888eeee35111aa65.jpg"},{"name":"Universal Absorption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/efe51809f09253cac12fa161ac6f5207fea3a92b.jpg"},{"name":"Intelligent Machine Evolution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574670/d44a9ba6c03948259067c59d99e3690629830e52.jpg"}],"total":76},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574670?t=1773927517","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574670/ba489d4d76c5a519e402e200fefc3c8130f16362/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773927517",